# File encoding (UTF-8)

All TypeScript/JavaScript source must be **UTF-8 without BOM**.

## After editing `.ts` / `.tsx` on Windows

- Prefer small `StrReplace` hunks over full-file `Write` when possible.
- If `tsc` reports mass `Invalid character` errors, the file was likely saved as UTF-16.
- Recovery: `git checkout -- <file>`, then rewrite with UTF-8 no-BOM, or run `pnpm fix:encoding`.

## Verify

Run `pnpm check:encoding` after large agent edits to source files.
